  dialogue:
  - Today's news - Two mountaineering enthusiasts discovered a damaged spacecraft
    object and reported it to the police. The scene has now been locked down, so
    please don't panic.
  - After identification and investigation by researchers from the authorities, it
    was confirmed that the object was from a satellite that had fallen. Please do
    not believe the rumors about aliens on the internet. Thank you for your cooperation.
